 "entities": {},
 "insight": [
  "Monthly imports of mineral fuels in Luxembourg have increased since 2020, reaching 194.1 million euros in December 2025.",
  "The imports grew by 112.3% from January 2020 to December 2025, starting at 91.4 million euros.",
  "The highest monthly import value was in October 2022, with 384.8 million euros.",
  "This peak coincides with the 2022 energy price shock, reflecting significant volatility in that period.",
  "The data are presented in current euros and are not adjusted for price changes, which may affect the interpretation of the trend."
 ],
